            <profile id="5fcc-2c6d-ecb0-7913" name="Equipment and options (as printed in WAB2 army list)" publicationId="b792-78e1-7b03-d4d6" hidden="false" typeId="b19e-ee0c-17d1-6e33" typeName="Equipment and Notes">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Yurt camp consisting of 3-5 Yurts. Each Yurt may have up to four Defenders armed with hand weapons and bows (may exchange bow for javelins). Yurt Deployment: the whole camp is deployed as one unit and must be placed on the table as the first unit; Yurts are deployed 3" apart in a circle or semi-circle with at least one Yurt touching the Nomad player's table edge. Yurts do not block line of sight. Defender Deployment: all Defenders are Skirmishers, count as one unit and may not take a Standard or a Musician; they are placed behind the Yurts and may not leave voluntarily; while inside they count as being behind soft cover. Victory Points: each undefended Yurt at the end of the game gives the opponent +5 Victory points. 0-1. (The Art of War p.78)</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
          </profiles>
          <costs>
            <cost name="pts" typeId="points" value="5"/>
          </costs>
