  <sharedRules>
    <rule id="0cc3-ae74-22ce-b2fa" name="Eastern Steppe Nomads: Wuhuan (Art of War) - List Notes" publicationId="b792-78e1-7b03-d4d6" hidden="false">
      <description>WUHUAN (The Art of War, pp.76-77). Special rule: Eastern Shock Cavalry. Allies documented only: Han Chinese from the Han Chinese list. Percentage limits are by points. "May only have one selected option per 1,000 points" for Special Units is documented only.

ARMY COMPOSITION:
[Wuhuan]
  Characters: up to 25%
  Cavalry: at least 50%
  Infantry: up to 25%
  Special Units: up to 25%
  WUHUAN. Characters up to 25%. Cavalry at least 50%. Infantry up to 25%. Special Units up to 25% (one selected option per 1,000 points). May have up to 25% Allies instead of selected options: Han Chinese from the Han Chinese list (documented only).</description>
    </rule>
  </sharedRules>
</catalogue>
